<title>USA: Clinton declares disaster in Washington state.</title>
<headline>Clinton declares disaster in Washington state.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton Friday declared a major disaster in two counties in Washington state hit by storms that caused mudslides and flooding.</p>
<p>The action makes residents of King and Snohomish county eligible for federal assistance for recovery efforts.</p>
</text>
